# SHA-256 fingerprint of the release signing certificate: 64 lowercase hex characters on its own line,
# no colons. Printed by tools/release/create-keystore.sh. The Release workflow refuses to publish an
# APK signed with any other certificate. Changing this line means the app can no longer be updated
# in place on existing installs (spec §3.4) — only ever change it via a reviewed PR.
